    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim uyakuhlonipha imfihlo yakho futsi akabutsani idatha yakho.\n\n• Kute kulandzelela: kute ema-SDK esikhangiso, kuhlatiya noma kulandzelela kwekumaketha.\n• Idatha ihlala kudivayisi yakho: yonkhe idatha yakho (indzawo, emasethingi, emabhukmaki) igcinwa endzaweni kudivayisi yakho kuphela:39000. ema-coordinates asetjentiselwa kubala tikhatsi temthandazo kanye ne-qibla kudivayisi yakho, futsi akaze atfunyelwe kunobe nguyiphi iseva yangaphandle.\n• Timvume kuphela uma tidzingeka: sicela timvume (indzawo, tatiso) kuphela uma sici sitidzinga mbamba, ngenchazelo lecacile ye-offline conctivity for app: No kusetjentiswa kwenethiwekhi kuyintfo yekutikhetsela ngalokuphelele ngetintfo letengetiwe letifana nekulandza tifundvo letifundvwako.\n\nLenchubomgomo iyincenye yendzawo yekugcina umtfombo lovulekile futsi ivulekele kubuyeketwa ngummango.</string>
